{
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Kitchen",
      "path": "home",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Automatic Programs",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:tune-variant"
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Bright",
              "icon": "mdi:white-balance-sunny",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "input_boolean.turn_on",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "input_boolean.lab_light"
                }
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6,
                "rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "All Off",
              "icon": "mdi:power",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "input_boolean.turn_off",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "input_boolean.lab_light"
                }
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6,
                "rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Assist",
              "icon": "mdi:message-processing-outline",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "assist"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "gauge",
              "entity": "input_number.lab_temperature",
              "name": "Kitchen temperature",
              "needle": true,
              "min": 45,
              "max": 95,
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 3
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Room Controls",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:knob"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "input_boolean.lab_light",
              "name": "All kitchen lights",
              "icon": "mdi:lightbulb",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "icon_tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Lighting circuits",
              "icon": "mdi:lightbulb-group-outline",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/lights"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Climate",
              "icon": "mdi:thermometer",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/climate"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "House Conditions",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:shield-home-outline"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% if is_state('input_boolean.lab_alert', 'on') %}\n- **Home alarm** · Pending\n- **Doors** · Open\n{% else %}\n- **Home alarm** · Disarmed\n- **Doors** · Closed\n{% endif %}\n- **Windows** · Closed\n- **Glass break** · Clear\n- **Cameras** · No lab feed",
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": "auto"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "input_boolean.lab_alert",
                  "state": "on"
                }
              ],
              "card": {
                "type": "shortcut",
                "label": "1 lab advisory",
                "icon": "mdi:alert-outline",
                "tap_action": {
                  "action": "navigate",
                  "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/maintenance"
                },
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": "full",
                  "rows": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Security",
              "icon": "mdi:shield-home",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/security"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "header": {
        "layout": "start",
        "badges_position": "bottom",
        "card": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text_only": true,
          "content": "# Kitchen\n\n`DOMESTIC CONTROL STATION` · Dashboard Lab"
        }
      },
      "badges": [
        {
          "type": "entity",
          "entity": "input_number.lab_temperature",
          "name": "Room temperature",
          "icon": "mdi:thermometer",
          "show_name": true,
          "show_state": true,
          "show_icon": true,
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "navigate",
            "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/climate"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Lighting",
      "path": "lights",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Lighting Circuits",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:lightbulb-group"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "input_boolean.lab_light",
              "name": "All kitchen lights",
              "icon": "mdi:lightbulb",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "icon_tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subview": true,
      "back_path": "/atomic-age-utility/home"
    },
    {
      "title": "Climate",
      "path": "climate",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Comfort Dial",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:thermometer"
            },
            {
              "type": "gauge",
              "entity": "input_number.lab_temperature",
              "name": "Kitchen temperature",
              "needle": true,
              "min": 45,
              "max": 95,
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "input_number.lab_temperature",
              "name": "Lab temperature",
              "icon": "mdi:thermometer",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              },
              "icon_tap_action": {
                "action": "more-info"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Temperature History",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:chart-line"
            },
            {
              "type": "history-graph",
              "entities": [
                "input_number.lab_temperature"
              ],
              "hours_to_show": 6,
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 4
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subview": true,
      "back_path": "/atomic-age-utility/home"
    },
    {
      "title": "Security",
      "path": "security",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "House Conditions",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:shield-home"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "{% if is_state('input_boolean.lab_alert', 'on') %}\n- **Home alarm** · Pending\n- **Doors** · Open\n{% else %}\n- **Home alarm** · Disarmed\n- **Doors** · Closed\n{% endif %}\n- **Windows** · Closed\n- **Glass break** · Clear\n- **Cameras** · No lab feed",
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": "auto"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Cameras",
              "icon": "mdi:cctv",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "navigate",
                "navigation_path": "/atomic-age-utility/cameras"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Simulate advisory",
              "icon": "mdi:alert-outline",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "input_boolean.turn_on",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "input_boolean.lab_alert"
                },
                "confirmation": {
                  "text": "Simulate an alarm advisory in the Dashboard Lab?"
                }
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subview": true,
      "back_path": "/atomic-age-utility/home"
    },
    {
      "title": "Cameras",
      "path": "cameras",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Cameras",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:cctv"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Dashboard Lab has no camera feeds.",
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": "auto"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subview": true,
      "back_path": "/atomic-age-utility/home"
    },
    {
      "title": "Maintenance",
      "path": "maintenance",
      "type": "sections",
      "theme": "Atomic Age Utility",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "dense_section_placement": false,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Local Advisories",
              "heading_style": "title",
              "icon": "mdi:wrench"
            },
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "input_boolean.lab_alert",
                  "state": "on"
                }
              ],
              "card": {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "**Lab advisory** · Simulated door status is open.",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": "full",
                  "rows": "auto"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "input_boolean.lab_alert",
                  "state": "off"
                }
              ],
              "card": {
                "type": "markdown",
                "content": "No active advisories.",
                "grid_options": {
                  "columns": "full",
                  "rows": "auto"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "shortcut",
              "label": "Clear lab advisory",
              "icon": "mdi:check",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "input_boolean.turn_off",
                "target": {
                  "entity_id": "input_boolean.lab_alert"
                }
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": "full",
                "rows": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subview": true,
      "back_path": "/atomic-age-utility/home"
    }
  ]
}
